  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1742738278_1241625_57aba60c350c827fcd41c516b9ab50d9.png",
  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">RockVine Artisan Surfaces sell a range of bespoke designer tables and surfaces typically for clients willing to spend over &pound;2,000 on a dining table We also work closely with interior designers and on commercial projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our main orders are for large Dining Tables and our average order value is &pound;2,400.00 across all our products. Our lowest value product is &pound;850.00&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Prices can go up to &pound;4,000.00 depending on the size and finish our clients order.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We specialise in:</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Polished Concrete Tables</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Textured and Metal Alloy Concrete Tables</li>\r\n<li style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Resin River Tables</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We primarily sell large dining tables - but we also make coffee tables and other surfaces. All of our products are bespoke and unique to the customer.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Our clients order online by paying 50% up front and the balance on delivery - we pay our affiliates immediately upon receipt of an order which has 50% or more paid in advance.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We do not clawback any commissions even if the client cancels the order at some future point. (This never happens!)</p>\r\n</div>",
